  "description": "Fluent, parameter-safe query builder for SurrealDB. Plugs into the official SurrealDb.Net SDK and provides SELECT / LIVE SELECT / CREATE / UPDATE / UPSERT / DELETE / KILL builders plus execution extensions on ISurrealDbClient. Every literal becomes a CBOR-bound parameter — no SQL injection, no hand-spliced SurrealQL. Also ships CBOR plumbing (`UseSurrealSnakeCase()`) that restores the snake_case naming convention and dynamic-map decoder that SurrealDb.Net dropped in 0.10.x.",
